    correctivePlan: ['Use a disease-management plan appropriate to the organism confirmed by the diagnostic laboratory and the production setting.', 'Remove or contain confirmed diseased material and residue as locally appropriate, then monitor tagged plants for new lesions.', 'Evaluate response using new lesion incidence and severity records; old necrotic tissue will not become healthy after correction.'],
